gPw(){return"DoSka is a personal project builder for Windows. It is a simple yet powerful visual planning app that helps you structure any task, from a business process to a study project.\n\nThe app runs entirely locally, with no internet connection or cloud services, so all your data stays on your computer.\n\nUse it to collect user stories, visualize processes and process charts, and break down tasks of any complexity."},
