gTh(){return"TimeFiller is a local scheduler for Windows, built for small teams. The app works completely offline, with no internet connection or cloud services, so all your data stays on your computer.\n\nUse it to manage employee vacations, book clients, plan meetings and recurring events, and organize work in sprints."},
