gOg(){return"A lightweight screen recorder for Windows"},
gOh(){return'Clip Ink is a lightweight screen recorder for Windows. Move and resize the frame over the area you need, click "Start recording", and get a regular MP4 that opens in any player and uploads to any platform. The frame itself stays out of the video: only what is inside it gets recorded.\n\nRecord a custom area, the whole screen, or an app window, with sound from the microphone, the system, or both. You can draw and add captions while recording.'},
