gOi(){return"One video can be up to 20 minutes long. When the limit is reached, the recording is saved automatically and you can start the next one right away."},
gOl(){return"Can I turn sound on and off while recording?"},
gOk(){return"Yes, you can mute and unmute the microphone and system audio during recording without stopping it."},
